{"parse": {"title": "LAFP-02", "pageid": 136121, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/LAFP-01\" title=\"LAFP-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">LAFP-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/LAFP-03\" title=\"LAFP-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">LAFP</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.9B.9E.E6.97.8B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"回旋\">回旋</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 回旋</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Spiral</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>只<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>绕<span class=\"color-value\"></span>了<span class=\"color-value\"></span>些<span class=\"color-value\"></span>远<span class=\"color-value\"></span>路<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3610102</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304716.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-304716.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304716.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304716.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-304716.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304716.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-304716.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304716.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>——该死的，你没长眼睛吗？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-508401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-508401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-508401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员：</div><div>你们拉普拉斯的秩序规范到底怎么回事？是你先在走廊上狂奔！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-508401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-508401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-508401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员：</div><div>等等，你是——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他看清了对方胸前满是牙印的工牌，明智地把不礼貌的措辞都吞了回去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508403.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-508403.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508403.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508403.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-508403.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-508403.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员：</div><div>兔毛手袋研究员？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>嗯？很好！听上去我的名字已经响彻整个基金会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>我急着去取样本，找乌尔里希去那边的研究室，找哑谜去他的办公室，找我就快滚，自己换个时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它往职员身后瞧了一眼，突然提起了兴趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>喔——让我猜猜！你们终于看不下去，打算给这地方塞上一个新任负责人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>还是哪位大发慈悲的老板批准了新实验楼的用地申请？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>再或者，要向这些好使唤的研究员们下达指令，修一艘诺亚方舟？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>听听我的建议吧！重启苦目素的食用研究，好在事情最糟糕的时候还能尝到点甜头！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>职员尴尬地摆着手，试图加快步子摆脱难以处理的麻烦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-508401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-508401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-508401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员：</div><div>按照规定，那是需要严格审批和管控的项目……我——我无权答复！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-508401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-508401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-508401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员：</div><div>我得立刻把资料送给哑谜先生——我不会再打扰您了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>啧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个小金属罐抛向了慌张的职员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508403.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-508403.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508403.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508403.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-508403.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-508403.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-304714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-304714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-304714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>把这个捎给他，盯着他吃下去！我的审批单已经等了30个小时，现在只有让他自己体验这份说服力了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-304714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-304714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-304714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>需要急救就按墙上的按钮。别按红色的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>来不及等待回复，兔毛手袋很快就拐进了下一个路口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>等待职员的只有远处紧闭的大门。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>我明白了。你可以走正式流程投诉兔毛手袋研究员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他将那个小金属罐随意地搁在了手边，接着抓起桌上的某样东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一枚纸团精准降落在职员脚边的废纸篓里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>它的诉求已被这位更慷慨的审批员受理。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>而你刚才提交的内容，按照目前其他项目的进度，会在大约69个工作日后得到答复。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-508401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-508401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-508401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员：</div><div>这是紧急任务，先生！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>完全理解。我也很遗憾这个机构不是一个许愿机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>如果你实在着急，把手里的东西放在左边那堆纸上。注意别碰倒其他东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-508401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-508401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-508401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员：</div><div>那么，最快能——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>52个工作日。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>原则上，我直接负责的部门只接受“暴雨”应对相关的研究任务。分析完成的数据才会交到我们手里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>你需要的数据处理和样本分析会交由其他小组进行，但这里没有闲着随叫随到的研究员。拉普拉斯科算中心也从来不是一台基金会专属的计算装置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>有任何异议或是特殊情况，就提交给总负责人好了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>遗憾的是这个位置至今空置，而我也只是代为处理没人在意的各种文件和事务。<br />你恐怕很难插上队。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>出去的时候记得关门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-508401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-508401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-508401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>出乎意料的是，职员没有进行一番激烈的辩论。但也没有挪动脚步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>门开着，你显然有独立移动的能力，以及辨认方向的智能。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501213.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-501213.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501213.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501213.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-501213.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501213.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-501213.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501213.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>很高兴看到你还保持着活力，阿德勒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究员惊愕地抬起头，熟悉的身影走入室内。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>看清来人后，他终于放下了手里的笔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>哦，还是位老朋友。这次你又打算替康斯坦丁取走什么东西？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>上一次拿走的报告想必让你们很满意吧。如果看上这些废纸堆中的任何一张，也请自便。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他摊开手，用力拍了拍旁边垒成小山的文件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>这次就不必了。如果之后有需要，我会再来拜访。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>马克。关于外勤人员配给品的调整方案，还有些细节要麻烦你去确认。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>乌尔里希先生和希曼女士会抽出十五分钟左右时间。在三号会议室。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-508401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-508401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-508401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员：</div><div>好的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>门合上了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>——你知道希曼女士今天会回来？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>大部分人都认为她是露西女士的专门助理，应当一同到司辰的箱子里休养。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>看来基金会对拉普拉斯的关注不比对重塑之手少。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究员讥讽地笑了笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>在一部分人看来，科学疯子和神秘学疯子差不多，前者的优点只在于可以提供些可普及的小发明。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>你仍然在以一个研究员的身份思考这些，阿德勒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>每个研究员都想要一间独立的、清净的实验室。这是相当简单的愿望，但它并不像想象中那样容易实现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>你应该不会专程过来进行说教。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>发生了什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>乌尔里希应该告知过你在南极发生的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>不久前，委外合约小队和其他调查员收集到的情报送到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-501211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-501211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-501211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>这次回溯将我们带到了1920年。也带来了一场不该存在的战争。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>“暴雨”绝非完全精确的程式，历史记载也常有谬误，以现有的理论体系而言，神秘学仍然保有部分模糊和不可知的特性……一点误差不该令你们意外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>尽管如此，研究员还是接过了那叠报告，快速地翻动着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>渐渐地，他的神色严肃起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-314312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-314312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-314312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>——这样的误差规模，不符合此前已有的任何模型。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314313.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/HeadIconSmall-314313.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314313.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314313.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/HeadIconSmall-314313.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314313.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/HeadIconSmall-314313.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314313.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>那场洪水冲毁了过去至少三分之二的研究结果！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-501211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-501211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-501211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>我们一直努力追赶着时代变化的速度。也早就习惯了被它突然远远抛下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-314310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-314310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-314310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>哈……因为没有“习惯”的人都没法再开口说话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一声嗤笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>突然间的倾覆一直都很难以面对。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>有过头一次，之后的会稍稍好接受一些。但仍有很多人提出异议。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>他们正在为是否要进入备战状态召开数不清的讨论会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>科算中心并不是一个军火库。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>较为激进的那部分人提出，既然长久以来对“暴雨”的研究会被这样突然地推翻，那么就应该重新规划对其的投入。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>而拉普拉斯科算中心的总负责人长期缺位，神秘主义团体“洛伦兹研究所”也从未被合理管控。有理由认为，这导致了研究效率低下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她打量着研究员的神情，知道对方已经猜出了自己的来意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>为了更好地确保对科算中心的支持工作确有价值，应该由基金会派遣一位受认可的负责人……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>绝无可能。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究员攥紧的拳头最终没有落在桌面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他咽下了愤怒。此刻愤怒毫无作用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>我并不认同这种观点，也不赞同科算中心应该被完全纳入基金会的管辖之下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>但实际情况是，除去精密的机械以外，由一位人类就任管理者，的确更有利于说服所有人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>——这正是我今天前来的原因。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>如果在这段短暂的混乱中，科算中心能拿出有说服力的新成果，将会很有帮助。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>当然，不论如何，我都会在会议上表达我对科算中心独立运作的支持。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究员注视着曾经的同僚。他们短暂地共事过，那已经是太久远的过去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>你希望科算中心倾向你，或者“你们”？政治那一套？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>你指望一群科学家将时间花在大谈局势和规划上，对着一堆粘土模型指手画脚？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>Z女士并没有直接回答这个问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>我希望你们能继续研究缪斯三世送来的“玩具箱”。借助它的模拟交出报告，并查明它模拟能力的来源。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>《雨前漫游指南》能反驳那些关于科算中心缺少避险规划的指责，而“玩具箱”核心的秘密，也许正是你们需要的“新成果”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……我明白了。但理由呢？你不会是出于无缘无故的同情才提供帮助。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>你对这座银色大厦到底抱持着什么看法？一种怀念，还是某种对科学的理想主义？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>Z女士略作停顿。随后，她提起了过去常被讨论的话题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>我仍然相信，也许会有一种理论。它包罗万象，能描述一个统一的宇宙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究员愣了愣，随后叹了一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>在这件事上，人们的进度是在绕了一个整整十年的大圈子之后，重新回到十一维。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>嗯。但这不意味着过往的努力毫无作用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她站起身，主动结束了这场谈话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-501201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-501201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-501201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>司辰希望能尽快得知外部时代的情况。有了分析结论后，请第一时间通知我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究室的门又一次合上了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_at_02.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_at_02\"><img alt=\"3_6_at_02\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/Cg-3_6_at_02.png/600px-Cg-3_6_at_02.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/Cg-3_6_at_02.png/900px-Cg-3_6_at_02.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/Cg-3_6_at_02.png/1200px-Cg-3_6_at_02.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>Z女士站在走廊上，抬头望着这座陌生的银白色大厦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>科学家……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>……能成为政治家吗？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "LAFP-02"}}